.TH DANBY-POLEVAULT 1
.SH NAME
danby-polevault \- coupled vaulter and elastic pole dynamics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/polevault
.SH MODEL
Run-up speed supplies initial angular motion and pole compression.  A damped
elastic mode exchanges energy with the vaulter's rotation under gravity.  Pole
length, stiffness, damping, mass, and gravity remain directly adjustable.
.SH DISPLAY
The three-point pole visibly bends while carrying the vaulter.  The graph shows
vaulter height and elastic energy stored in the pole.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/polevault.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR mechanism (2)
